id: SAFE35-3
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: transition_limit
target: crates/core/src/transit.rs
find:     state.run = run_before.clone();
replace:     state.run.current = run_before.current.clone();
expect-fail: cycle_exit_2_stops_at_limit
expect-fail: cycle_exit_2_accepts_again_and_returns_again
note: 実行状態を戻さず現在の Step だけ戻す（止めた操作の達成が残り、次の入力が受け付けられない）
